id: E8211-draft-2501_91199785
trigger_tool: libtoolize|autoreconf|automake
phase: bootstrap|build
error_signature: "libtoolize.*bin/grep: inaccessible or not found|libtoolize: putting auxiliary files in '\\.'|required file 'config/ltmain.sh' not found"
severity: 2
category: autotools|libtool|ohos|build-system
match_keywords: libtoolize, GREP, EGREP, FGREP, AC_CONFIG_AUX_DIR, ltmain.sh, stale absolute path, conanbuild
title: A stale GREP path in libtoolize can silently misplace ltmain.sh despite AC_CONFIG_AUX_DIR
root_cause: >
  The OHOS libtoolize package defaults GREP/EGREP/FGREP to a non-existent
  /data/service/hnp/bin/grep. Its configure.ac trace then fails to see
  AC_CONFIG_AUX_DIR(config), silently chooses the source root for auxiliary
  files, and copies ltmain.sh there. Automake correctly requires
  config/ltmain.sh and aborts. The initial grep failure is nonfatal, so the
  later missing-file error appears unrelated unless both log lines are read.
affected_scope: Autotools/Libtool projects with AC_CONFIG_AUX_DIR and a libtoolize binary whose compiled-in grep commands are unavailable on the build host
verification_cmd: "run autoreconf -fi with GREP=grep EGREP='grep -E' FGREP='grep -F'; require 'putting auxiliary files in AC_CONFIG_AUX_DIR' and config/ltmain.sh before configure"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: override-libtoolize-grep-family-in-build-environment
rec_description: >
  Validate the grep implementation in the build environment and pass GREP,
  EGREP and FGREP to autoreconf/libtoolize. Recreate only generated files in
  the task-local build tree. Keep the explicit AC_CONFIG_AUX_DIR location;
  do not move ltmain.sh by hand or patch the shared Conan tool package.
rec_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: "copy ltmain.sh from source root into config and treat build as fixed"
forbid_1_reason: masks the broken libtoolize trace and may misplace future generated auxiliary files
forbid_2_pattern: "ignore libtoolize grep error because libtoolize returned zero"
forbid_2_reason: the error can change the selected auxiliary directory without making libtoolize fail
similar_to: E521, E514, E729-draft-GSSN
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/E8211-draft-2501_91199785.md
source_event: archives/l/libgenome/1.3.11-svn20110227.4616; W3 batches 20260926T134000Z and 20260926T142000Z
last_updated: 2026-09-26
draft: true
